{"id":851071,"title":"49｜测试并完善App","content":"本节课继续完善换脸项目，主要任务是在图片下方添加保存到相册按钮，并调整页面布局。首先在Xcode中添加日志并清除旧日志，尝试编译时遇到错误，通过多次复制和接受修改逐步解决。问题主要出在新文件未加入项目中，添加后编译成功。测试过程中发现API调用频繁失败，输出为空，这与COS服务端执行有关。为解决此问题，增加了重试机制，最大重试次数为三次，若仍失败则提示用户并建议控制图片大小。再次编译后，换脸功能在多次请求后成功，但保存到相册无提示，进一步修改代码以增加保存成功的提示。最终，项目实现换脸并保存到相册的功能，且有明确的用户反馈。通过五个案例的学习，学员掌握了使用特定工具开发小程序、APP及网站的基本技能。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":406113,"user_name":"文静的安迪","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1220040,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"57ED0A746CE3BC","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/9d/c8/3d975586.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1774017716,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":150950,"content":"coze有长期token，我记得好像在申请api key的时候能选择时长。你研究一下","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1224950,"ctime":1774195838,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":406113,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100855101,"comment_content":"老师你好，从coze拿到的token,生成几次就会过期：access token invalid.都需要重新去API复制token,这个怎么解决？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1224950,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/b0/f6/eb6a8f61.jpg","nickname":"郭旭","note":"","ucode":"7CC6787BD0F0A9","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":682641,"discussion_content":"coze有长期token，我记得好像在申请api key的时候能选择时长。你研究一下","content_length":94,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1774195838,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":398087,"user_name":"浩仔是程序员","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1104601,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"A7E5CF9E1571A2","user_header":"https://static001.gee